---
import SiteLayout from "../layouts/SiteLayout.astro";
---

<SiteLayout
  title="Solutions | Z Best Media"
  description="Explore enterprise solutions from Z Best Media across campaign operations, content systems, intelligence workflows, and governance execution."
  path="/solutions"
>
  <section class="grid gap-5">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-semibold leading-tight">Solutions</h1>
    <p class="text-muted max-w-[75ch]">
      Enterprise teams do not need generic software promises. They need outcomes tied to execution reality: faster launch cycles,
      lower operational risk, clearer governance posture, and stronger decision intelligence. Z Best Media delivers solutions as
      integrated operating systems, not disconnected point features. Each solution combines workflow design, enforcement logic,
      observability, and leadership reporting. This allows business units to move quickly while maintaining consistency across policy,
      brand standards, and compliance obligations.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="mt-10 grid gap-4">
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold">Campaign Operations Modernization</h2>
    <p class="text-muted max-w-[75ch]">
      We modernize campaign operations by replacing fragmented toolchains with one governed command model. Planning, queueing, approvals,
      and monitoring are aligned inside a single operating surface so teams can see dependencies and risk before launch windows close.
      This reduces handoff loss and keeps teams focused on execution quality instead of coordination friction. Leadership gains reliable
      operational telemetry with clear ownership paths, while operators gain fewer manual transitions and stronger safeguards for high
      impact changes.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="mt-10 grid gap-4">
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold">Content System Hardening</h2>
    <p class="text-muted max-w-[75ch]">
      Content organizations scale when standards are executable. Our content solution enforces pre-publication checks, schema-driven
      metadata, and deterministic approval flows for multi-channel distribution. Teams can produce at volume while preserving quality and
      legal alignment because acceptance criteria are machine-enforced, not informally interpreted. This prevents last-minute breakdowns,
      reduces rework, and improves the trust relationship between strategy leaders, creators, and compliance stakeholders.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="mt-10 grid gap-4">
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold">Competitive and Opposition Intelligence</h2>
    <p class="text-muted max-w-[75ch]">
      Intelligence loses value when collection is ad hoc and reporting is inconsistent. We implement structured intelligence pipelines that
      capture evidence, normalize it by schema, and map outputs directly to strategic decision frameworks. Teams can compare movement over
      time, identify narrative shifts early, and issue executive briefs with provable source chains. This improves planning quality and
      reduces reaction lag in competitive environments where timing and signal clarity directly affect outcomes.
    </p>
    <div class="rounded-xl border border-border bg-panel overflow-hidden max-w-[75ch]">
      <div class="p-3 border-b border-border text-sm text-muted">Research Visual Slot</div>
      <div class="aspect-[16/8] flex items-center justify-center text-sm text-muted text-center px-6">
        Drop research still at <code class="text-gold">apps/web/src/assets/research.webp</code>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="mt-10 grid gap-4">
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold">Governance and Audit Readiness</h2>
    <p class="text-muted max-w-[75ch]">
      Many organizations discover governance gaps only during incidents or external review. We solve that by operationalizing governance
      from day one: signed contracts, canary controls, integrity scoring, and immutable audit evidence. Teams know current posture
      continuously and can demonstrate control health without emergency data reconstruction. This lowers enterprise risk and strengthens
      confidence during leadership reporting, client assurance, and formal compliance interactions.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="mt-10 grid gap-4">
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold">Delivery Model</h2>
    <p class="text-muted max-w-[75ch]">
      Engagements are phased for low disruption and measurable progress. We begin with an operating baseline assessment, define target
      controls and workflows, deploy in constrained slices, and validate outcomes against business and governance metrics. This approach
      protects active operations while giving teams fast wins and a clear scale path. Your teams retain ownership, and the system remains
      transparent, documented, and maintainable after rollout.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="mt-12 rounded-xl border border-border bg-surface p-6 grid gap-3">
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold">Choose the Right Solution Path</h2>
    <p class="text-muted max-w-[72ch]">
      Tell us where your delivery is slowing down or where risk is concentrating, and we will propose a practical solution sequence.
      Contact <a class="hover:text-text" href="tel:+12136328384">(213) 632-8384</a> or
      <a class="hover:text-text" href="mailto:hello@zbestmedia.com"> hello@zbestmedia.com</a>.
    </p>
    <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3">
      <a href="/contact" class="rounded-xl bg-gold px-5 py-3 text-bg font-semibold">Book a Strategic Brief</a>
      <a href="/platform" class="rounded-xl border border-border px-5 py-3">View Platform Architecture</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</SiteLayout>
